note right of UC084
  **Single Candle Logic:**
  - Body size ratio
  - Upper/lower shadow length
  - Position in trend
  - Body to total range ratio
  
  Example (Hammer):
  - Small body at top
  - Long lower shadow (2x body)
  - Little/no upper shadow
end note

note right of UC085
  **Two Candle Logic:**
  - Compare consecutive candles
  - Body size relationship
  - Open/close positions
  - Engulfing criteria
  
  Example (Bullish Engulfing):
  - Candle 2 body > Candle 1 body
  - C2 opens below C1 close
  - C2 closes above C1 open
end note

note right of UC092
  **Cup with Handle:**
  1. Identify cup shape (U-shaped)
  2. Calculate cup depth
  3. Find handle pattern
  4. Measure handle depth
  5. Validate breakout point
  
  Min period: 7 weeks
  Handle: 1-4 weeks
end note

note right of UC095
  **Triangle Detection:**
  - Identify converging trendlines
  - Calculate apex point
  - Measure height & width
  - Determine breakout direction
  
  Types: Ascending, Descending,
  Symmetrical
end note

note right of UC101
  **Multi-Pattern Feature:**
  - Select up to 49 patterns
  - Search by name
  - Category tabs
  - Badge shows count
  - Real-time update
end note

note bottom of UC111
